{"ref":"BDB, חֹבְלִים","hw":"חֹבְלִים","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹבְלִים</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>]<strong>pl. union</strong> (lit. <em>binders</em>) name of Zec.’s second symbolic staff <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.7\">Zc 11:7</a> and c. art. v <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:14\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.14\">14</a>. See <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָבַל\" href=\"/BDB,_חָבַל\", dir=\"rtl\">חָבַל</a> <strong>1</strong>.","next":"BDB, תַּחְבֻּלָה","prev":"BDB, חֹבֵל"}